WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.192
The Queen of Saba, from a faraway land, heard of Sulayman's wisdom and came to visit him, bringing gifts.

2
00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:13.720
Sulayman asked, Who can bring me the Queen's throne? A jinn said, I can bring it before you rise from your seat.

3
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:20.840
But a man of knowledge said, I can bring it before you blink. And in an instant, the throne stood in the palace.

4
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:27.720
The Queen entered the crystal palace. The floor gleamed like water, so she lifted her skirt, afraid of getting it wet.

5
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:33.808
Sulayman smiled, Do not worry. It is a floor of smooth glass. She was amazed.

6
00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:41.960
Then she saw her throne and cried out, This looks just like my throne! She looked closely and recognized it.

7
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:47.280
The Queen saw the glory of Allah. She said, I believe in the One Allah!
